    "intro": "Following the successful design of The Knowledge Academy's main office, our team at TwentyOne06, in partnership with fit-out giants, Havelock One, was brought back to reimagine their newest training center, a 300 sqm space located in I-Rise Tower, Barsha Heights, Dubai.",
