    "intro": "Reif Kushiyaki is a restaurant we designed for Michelin-awarded Chef Reif Othman, bringing his unconventional take on Far-Eastern cuisine to life through immersive interiors. As the first licensed, full-service location in the UAE, the space blends elevated design with playful storytelling, offering an intimate and dynamic dining experience where guests are fully immersed in the energy of the open kitchen and bar.",
