          "The space is vibrant, eclectic, and full of personality, balancing playfulness with sophistication. The mix of modern finishes and cultural references results in a dynamic atmosphere that feels distinctly Korean yet uniquely Reif Othman. Bespoke decorative lighting, handcrafted signage, and theatrical Korean elements set the tone for an immersive dining experience."
